```
Right now `production` == **v{{ prompt_versions.v1 }}** (the stale prompt), so this run (`ev-grant-prod-v{{ prompt_versions.v1 }}`)
goes **red** — the managed judge fails every disputed item (no grant applied).

Now **promote v2 to `production`** (Prompts → `{{ prompt_name }}` → set the `production` label on v{{ prompt_versions.v2 }}),
and run the **same command** again:
```
